  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/A1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Direct analyze_cpp on the 9-line fixture: SYM a.cc:5-5:AcceptWaveform:method (bare), EDGE calls AcceptWaveform@5 -> AcceptWaveform@5 (self), OnlineStream::AcceptWaveform -> cpp:external:0-0:AcceptWaveform:unresolved {hint Impl}; no class symbol for `class OnlineStream::Impl {}` and no feat_extractor_ field; `struct A::S` gives bare f, g. Both cpp.py:1026-1027 (class arm) and :1458-1463 (_get_enclosing_class) use _find_child_by_type(node, 'type_identifier'), which a qualified_identifier name fails. The survey drops the self-loop; the direct call shows it. Only a pragma comment changed in cpp.py since 10-25. ROOT-CAUSE GROUP: owner/container read from the name node, not lexical position (with INV-dosoz, WI-sipoj). Status unchanged."  # c2ca
